        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>LabelSeriesAccountingPolicyHint</name>
          <id>485</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>The warehouse &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>does not use &lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e> &lt;/>the warehouse management when recording surpluses, shortage and damage, so only reference batch specification is available.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>انبار &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>از &lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e> &lt;/>مدیریت انبار هنگام ثبت اضافات، کسورات و خسارت استفاده نمی‌کند، بنابراین فقط تعیین بچ مرجع در دسترس است.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Nel magazzino &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>non si utilizza&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>io&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e> &lt;/> lo schema d'ordine nella visualizzazione delle eccedenze, mancanze e deterioramento, pertanto è possibile soltanto la visualizzazione della nota informativa delle serie.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>W magazynie &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>nie jest stosowany&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>я&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e> &lt;/>schemat zleceniowy podczas odzwierciedlenia nadwyżek niedoboru i uszkodzeń, dlatego możliwe jest tylko pomocnicze wskazanie serii.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>На складе &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>не используетс&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>я&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e> &lt;/>ордерная схема при отражении излишков недостач и порчи, поэтому возможно только справочное указание серий.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Ambarda; fazlalıklar, eksiklikler ve stok kalite değişiklikleri yansıtılırken &lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>&lt;/>ambar yönetimi &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>kullanılmamaktadı&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>r, bu nedenle partinin yalnızca referans gösterimi mümkündür.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Trong kho &lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>không sử &lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;b>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>dụng&lt;/>&lt;/>&lt;colorstyle 0:b9627855-6773-4a59-b7d3-f9e2e565cd9e>&lt;/>sơ đồ hai pha khi phản ánh hàng thừa, hàng thiếu và hàng hỏng, do đó chỉ có thể chỉ ra sê-ri để tra cứu.</value>
          </title>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
